<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 8.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   March 1, 2004 CCT	    Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.98 pct		6.12 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.99 pct		7.01 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.00		   99.10</p>
<p>    Total bids	 15,599 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    8.0   trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are for a previous auction on March 13 of a 2.0 trillion lire first tranche of the CCTs.</p>
</text>
